    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Until the spell ends, your Hit Point maximum increases by 10, and you regain an extra 1d6 Hit Points whenever you regain Hit Points.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The extra healing increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-Id71sDUTBTpMg4cc\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Use <em>Extra Healing</em> each time you regain Hit Points, choosing the level you cast the spell at.</p></section>",
